OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a cloudy day with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, heavy at times. A
OL,7,Frather cool and breezy day with strong
OL,8,Fnorthwesterly winds developing across
OL,9,FKintyre and the Isles.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with further outbreaks
OL,12,Fof rain through the evening then
OL,13,Fbecoming mainly dry later in the
OL,14,Fnight. Winds easing overnight.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FThere will be variable
OL,17,Famounts of cloud with bright spells
OL,18,Fand scattered showers. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
